  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I don't like the way the banner is just taking up HALF of my quick menu. \nIt looks bad,\nIt takes up half of the Quick Menu\nAnd \"getting real time updates\" probably will effect users with poor internet. \nI also pay for VRC+, so I really don't want to see more Ads when I log in. I can look on your forums or the website, or the status website.\nI don't need it, and we all lived without it before.\nPlease remove or make it Toggleable",
